      "note": "Hit keys reconciled 2026-10-04 with Genshin Optimizer's Vesna sheet (frzyc/genshin-optimizer PR #3316, branch van/go/7.1): skill sword1Dmg / sword2Dmg / sword2SpiritDmg / sword3SpiritDmg / sword3SpiritFinalDmg (+ *StellarswirlDmg twins), burst spiritDmg / spiritStellarswirlDmg, constellation6 transposeDmg / swordDmg / swordStellarswirlDmg; C6 hits are plain Anemo DMG in GO (no skill_dmg_). The guessed names in the original note below are superseded. Original note: Added 2026-09-22 (7.1 release day); Amber/yatta and Genshin Optimizer had no entry yet, so hit keys are GUESSES in GO's vocabulary (camelCased nanoka labels + Odette's *StellarswirlDmg spelling), to be reconciled once GO ships a Vesna sheet: normal 0-5 (GO's '3x2' convention: normal/2 is ONE 55.5% instance, weight it 2), charged dmg, plunging dmg/low/high, skill skillDmg / windborneSword1Dmg / windborneSword2Dmg / windborneSword2SpiritBladeDmg / windborneSword3SpiritBladeDmg (label says x4: ONE instance, weight it 4) / windborneSword3SpiritBladeFinalDmg / windPinionDmg, each Spirit Blade with a *StellarswirlDmg twin (same multiplier; the Radiance: Stellar Swirl form -- never score both forms of one instance), burst spiritBladeDmg + spiritBladeStellarswirlDmg, constellation6 transposeDmg + transposeSpiritBladeDmg (+ Stellar twin), 150% / 200% of ATK as fixed constants. INFUSION IS BAKED: Normal/Charged/Plunging are seeded Anemo, not physical, because Armed for Action (her Elemental Skill mode, the only state a Vesna rotation happens in) converts them and cannot be overridden -- the Cryo Traveler / Xiao exception, not the roster rule. The wind pinion (summoned alongside her attacks in that mode) and Windborne Sword are listed under the Elemental Skill in-game and are tagged skill_dmg_; the C6 Transpose strike is tagged skill_dmg_ on the same reading (it is 'the secret Vila ability', cast from the skill button) -- both are unverified classifications. Spirit Blade hits carry the spiritblade_dmg_ scope key in BOTH forms so A1 Disciplinary Action's base-DMG multiplier (spiritblade_base_dmg_) reaches them and nothing else.",
